OL,3,GNEWSAPony herd gathering raises money
OL,4,Afor air ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA herd of ponies on Exmoor is being
OL,7,Fgathered as part of an annual
OL,8,Finspection.
OL,10,FTippbarlake Exmoor Pony Herd has about
OL,11,F100 ponies, which are being gathered in
OL,12,FBrendon Barton on Sunday.
OL,14,FKristina Auckland, who looks after the
OL,15,Fherd with her family, said gathering
OL,16,Fponies on Exmoor was a tradition that
OL,17,Fhad been going on for generations.
OL,19,FShe said members of the public were
OL,20,Fable to watch at Scobhill Gate from
OL,21,F10:00 for free but would be asked to
OL,22,Fdonate to the Devon Air Ambulance.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
